{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:07:48+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Samurai GUNN 2", "steam_appid": 1397790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---PLAYABLE CHARACTERS---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAMURAI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Otomo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hayao</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slug</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helmsley</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDS / GUEST CHARACTERS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranno from <i>Rivals of Aether</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned (In no particular order)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAMURAI</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KD</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isao</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Devil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peanut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toshio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Donk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDS / GUEST CHARACTERS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spelunky Crew from <i>Spelunky 2</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minit Gang from <i>Minit</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crewmate/Imposter from <i>Among Us</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---MODES---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and Free-for All Versus (Local)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and Free-for-All Versus - Casual Matchmaking (Online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Versus - Ranked Matchmaking (Online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Practice Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target Practice</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In Progress...</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Player Onboarding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game Modes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2v2 Versus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Specific Tutorial Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic Reader</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---TECH---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a custom game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite entire game in custom game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollback netcode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raycast Lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck native version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D3D12 + Vulkan support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coward Punishment (punish players for running away)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Match Spectating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby features</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In Progress...</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash and Desync Fixes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Lock in! Samurai GUNN 2 is a bloody and brutally fast platform fighter for players who like short rounds and intense action.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends  on the couch, or play online in 1v1 and Free-for-All battles. Enjoy reliable rollback netcode in Ranked and Casual Matchmaking. You can even set up a private lobby to hang out and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHARACTERS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAYAO</strong> is the best character to start with. He is by far the fastest character in the game, and in Samurai GUNN 2, that makes him one of the strongest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTOMO </strong>shoots fireballs that can trap opponents (and herself if you’re not careful!). She can slash through her fire traps to gain an incredible boost of speed for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOLEM </strong>can create destructible stone blocks with his bullets. He can even create statues that can obstruct, frustrate, and crush opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POPS </strong>is slow and strong–very dangerous in close quarters. He can dash-grab opponents and send them flying to their explosive deaths. He can even dash-grab their bullets and return-to-sender. His bullets explode on impact and the splash damage can kill through walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>GHOST </strong>has an echo float ability that makes her unpredictable in air combat. Pay close attention because her bullets are invisible, She can temporarily turn invisible as well when she dashes. Chain together successive kills to remain invisible and terrify your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>SLUG</strong> is the choice for high IQ players. So many tricks–he can stick to walls and run on the ceiling. He shoots kunai instead of bullets that he (or his opponents!) can retrieve and re-fire. He can tilt the kunai in unpredictable directions. He’s kind of slow, but he has a fast-fall mixup to catch opponents off-guard. Try him once you’ve mastered the basics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helmsley is our most complicated character by far. Grind along stage surfaces to earn ammo, then use ammo to charge up your next move, whether that's firing a shotgunn with crazy spread, or going full berserk with a giant iron sword. Do you have the <i>guts</i> to take on Helmsley's mental load? Mastering Helmsley will require even the best Samurai Gunn players to retrain their muscle memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SAMURAI GUNN 2 × RIVALS OF AETHER</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RANNO </strong>plays completely differently than the samurai characters, retaining his unique traits from <strong><i>Rivals of Aether</i></strong>. Fast on the ground + slow in the air, Ranno can fling around the stage with his toxic tongue grab, launch a spread of poisonous darts, and tumble unsuspecting opponents with his bubble trap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>REGULAR UPDATES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We devoted 3 years to rebuilding Samurai GUNN 2 from scratch in our own custom engine to ensure the online matches are fast and reliable, and to make it easy for us to support for years to come. With this solid foundation in place, you can look forward to regular updates with new characters, new stages, new modes, and various other improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the Roadmap above for the full list of updates: completed, in progress, and planned.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Lock in! Samurai GUNN 2 is a bloody and brutally fast platform fighter for players who like short rounds and intense action.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends  on the couch, or play online in 1v1 and Free-for-All battles. Enjoy reliable rollback netcode in Ranked and Casual Matchmaking. You can even set up a private lobby to hang out and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHARACTERS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAYAO</strong> is the best character to start with. He is by far the fastest character in the game, and in Samurai GUNN 2, that makes him one of the strongest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video