r><strong>SLUG</strong> is the choice for high IQ players. So many tricks–he can stick to walls and run on the ceiling. He shoots kunai instead of bullets that he (or his opponents!) can retrieve and re-fire. He can tilt the kunai in unpredictable directions. He’s kind of slow, but he has a fast-fall mixup to catch opponents off-guard. Try him once you’ve mastered the basics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0d52594ec6313d928587f38a53f51d1c.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helmsley is our most complicated character by far. Grind along stage surfaces to earn ammo, then use ammo to charge up your next move, whether that's firing a shotgunn with crazy spread, or going full berserk with a giant iron sword. Do you have the <i>guts</i> to take on Helmsley's mental load? Mastering Helmsley will require even the best Samurai Gunn players to retrain their muscle memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SAMURAI GUNN 2 × RIVALS OF AETHER</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.poster.avif?t=1781929292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.webm?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e31e8beaaf55a102b0699ce69bee17f6.mp4?t=1781929292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RANNO </strong>plays completely differently than the samurai characters, retaining his unique traits from <strong><i>Rivals of Aether</i></strong>. Fast on the ground + slow in the air, Ranno can fling around the stage with his toxic tongue grab, launch a spread of poisonous darts, and tumble unsuspecting opponents with his bubble trap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>REGULAR UPDATES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We devoted 3 years to rebuilding Samurai GUNN 2 from scratch in our own custom engine to ensure the online matches are fast and reliable, and to make it easy for us to support for years to come. With this solid foundation in place, you can look forward to regular updates with new characters, new stages, new modes, and various other improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the Roadmap above for the full list of updates: completed, in progress, and planned.</p>", "short_description": "Lock in! Samurai GUNN 2 is a bloody and brutally fast platform fighter for players who like short rounds and intense action. Free Edition out now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/6784838e24ce0431c513af76f7beb070086d79eb/header.jpg?t=1781929292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/9120e0bd76874630eea49712a118e6a20b35104a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781929292", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/9120e0bd76874630eea49712a118e6a20b35104a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781929292", "website": "https://samurai